    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even \"experiencing\" feels heavy. it feels like i'm just inhabiting a shell. if the purpose of a life is to create, to contribute, to be... something, then what am i if that's gone? it feels like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. there's no beauty in just existing if there's nothing to express. it just feels like a long, slow fade to black that's already been decided.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
